app.note:
"geslechte" hier für "gentes" in V, im Sinne von "Völker";
               entsprechend den Belegen bei Diefenbach (S. 260) wäre eher das Interpretament "volke"
               zu erwarten. Auch bei LAO "geſlecht/e". (MK + VS)

"geslechte" here for "gentes" in V, in the sense of "peoples";
               according to the evidence in Diefenbach (p. 260), the interpretation "volke" would
               rather be expected. Also in LAO "geſlecht/e". (MK + VS)

The word "er" should be added. The writer may have a "machter" or
               "macht er" in the original; the pronoun is lost due to the line break. LAO different
               from WB with personal pronoun "er". (MK + VS)
